Arara Code: make folder chords and Control+E available on macOS.

Why a patch: these native workbench defaults are registered before extensions
load. Product configuration cannot add a platform-specific secondary binding
to these registrations. Keep every existing platform and user override intact.
Touches: src/vs/workbench/browser/actions/workspaceActions.ts,
         src/vs/workbench/browser/actions/quickAccessActions.ts

--- a/src/vs/workbench/browser/actions/workspaceActions.ts
